# 6. The matrix number

The matrices don't need to store their number inside the file.

The program determines it from their position.

If:

```python
matrices[0]
```

then:

```text
Matrix 1
```

If:

```python
matrices[1]
```

then:

```text
Matrix 2
```

If:

```python
matrices[2]
```

then:

```text
Matrix 3
```

This is important because it means you can't accidentally get:

```text
Matrix 1
Matrix 7
Matrix 3
Matrix 42
```

The order itself determines the number.

