# 9. What happens when Enter reaches the end

Suppose you're here:

```text
[1] [2] [3]
[4] [5] [6]
[7] [8] [9]
             ↑
```

and press Enter.

There isn't another variable inside that matrix.

So the program interprets that as:

```text
END MATRIX
```

It reads the current GUI values back into Python:

```python
[
    [1, 2, 3],
    [4, 5, 6],
    [7, 8, 9]
]
```

and saves it.

Then it creates the next matrix:

```text
Matrix 2
```

