# 10. Ctrl+Enter

Ctrl+Enter is the explicit version of:

```text
FINISH THIS MATRIX
```

So you could have:

```text
[1] [2] [3]
[4] [5] [6]
[7] [8] [9]
```

and press:

```text
Ctrl + Enter
```

The program doesn't ask:

> "Are you sure?"

It interprets it as:

```text
finish matrix
→ save
→ advance
```

This is useful when you don't want to reach the last cell manually.

