# 15. Deleting folders

The deletion rule you specified is important:

> only delete folders if they're empty

So if:

```text
📁 experiments
```

contains:

```text
matrix_001.txt
```

then:

```text
Delete
```

must refuse.

But:

```text
📁 empty_folder
```

can be deleted.

Conceptually:

```python
if folder_is_empty:
