# 18. Saving

When saving, the reverse happens.

The GUI currently contains:

```python
QLineEdit
QLineEdit
QLineEdit
...
```

The program reads their contents.

It reconstructs:

```python
[
    [1, 2, 3],
    [4, 5, 6]
]
```

and writes:

```text
1 2 3
4 5 6

```

Then the next matrix:

```text
10 20
30 40
```

and so on.

So the conversion is:

```text
TEXT FILE
    ↕
PYTHON DATA
    ↕
GUI CELLS
```

That's the central architecture.

